questions.explanation:
 SELECT is used to retrieve or display data from one or more tables.
Example:
SELECT * FROM Student;

COMMIT permanently saves the changes made during a transaction.
Example:
UPDATE Student SET marks = 90 WHERE id = 1;
COMMIT;

